// Keleustes node protocol, v1.
//
// A belai host ("node") joins a Keleustes server once with a single-use
// join token (Node.Join) and receives a client certificate signed by the
// server's local CA. Every other RPC requires that certificate (mutual TLS).
//
// Two kinds of traffic:
