//   belai process (an OS file lock decides which). Presence, host advert,
//   and server→node work that is addressed to the host rather than to a
//   session: dispatches (start a session/worker/crew), jobs (GitHub or model
//   work), factory control (stop, A2A blackout). Server frames carry a seq;
//   the node acks the highest it applied and the server replays the rest
//   after a reconnect.
//
